   "patch_url": "https://github.com/liuleisail/family-proxy-manual/pull/97.patch",
   "merged_at": "2026-09-26T00:36:04Z"
  },
  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Route Telegram client traffic through the `Telegram` business group so the `TG-出口/TG-应急` failover is no longer bypassed by direct `TG-Auto` rules.\n- Add Meta Muse domains (`muse.ai`, `metaaivm.com`, `meta.ai`, `meta.com`) to `US-AI`.\n- Keep those rules consistent in both `family-mihomo-sub-import.py` and `family-proxy-ui.py` so rule migrations do not reintroduce legacy `TG-Auto` routes.\n- Preserve per-pool airport source locks during `replace-clear` and invalidate stale pending suggestions when scopes change.\n\n## Notes\n\n- No release/tag is being published with this change.\n- Control plane deployed to Z4Pro and verified with `verify-server.sh` / `verify-dns-routing.sh --quick`.",
